Z||000001||skitime||05-26-2001||09:32 PM||||TRiad,  Let me welcome you to the forum and thanks for the compliment on my car.  I got the chin spoiler idea from forum member Lawrence. I made it myself and is made of urethane not fiberglass. Fiberglass chin spoilers tend to break very easy but not urethane. Urethane is what the lower body panels are made from on the Fiero.  I got the side scoops from forum member Rockcrawl. They are the orginal Mecham scoops made of urethane as well, not fiberglass.  Thanks for the great pic Old Lar.  TRiad you got mail.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/SkitimeGT-1.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by skitime (edited 05-26-2001).]||||reg||1
